hat you have enough time to complete your project. \r\n</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><b>Essential Speaking Time Calculator</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nA text-to-speaking time calculator is an essential tool that can be useful for a wide range of individuals and professionals. This calculator can help you determine the exact time it takes to deliver a speech or read through a piece of text, making it a great resource for public speakers, podcasters, and content creators.\r\n<br>\r\nInstead of having to manually calculate the time it takes to deliver a speech or read through a script, simply enter the text into the calculator and receive an accurate estimate of the time it will take.\r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/essential-speaking-time-calculator.jpg","alt":"voice-over-word-count-calculator","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"blog-post-section ","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><b>Free To Use from <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\">VoiceoverGuy!</a></b></h2>\r\n<p>Help yourself. \r\n<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"if (window.sidebar && window.sidebar.addPanel) { /* Mozilla Firefox Bookmark */ window.sidebar.addPanel(document.title,window.location.href,''); } else if( window.external && ('AddFavorite' in window.external)) { /* Internet Explorer Favorite */ window.external.AddFavorite(location.href,document.title); } else if(window.opera && window.print) { /* Opera Hotlist */ this.title=document.title; return true; } else { /* Other Browsers */ alert('Press ' + (navigator.userAgent.toLowerCase().indexOf('mac') != -1 ? 'Command/Cmd' : 'CTRL') + ' + D to bookmark this page.'); } return false;\">Bookmark this page!</a>\r\n\r\n</p>"}}],null]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><b>Improve Your Public Speaking Skills</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nThis text-to-speaking time calculator can help you improve your public speaking skills by enabling you to refine your delivery and pacing. With a better understanding of how long your speech will take, you can adjust your delivery and make sure you are delivering your message effectively.\r\n<br>\r\nOverall, a text-to-speaking time calculator is valuable for anyone needing to deliver a speech or read through a piece of text, and can improve the efficiency and effectiveness of your communication.\r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Voice-Over - Time Word Count Calculator","pageUrl":"voice-over-word-count-calculator"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","933",{"href":"/lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover.jpg","alt":"lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Lumote Mastermote Chronicles – Attenborough Voice"}]]}],["$","$L4","589",{"href":"/cities-talking-explainer-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/cities-talking-explainer-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-r